# Rollout facts

The API uses a rolling deployment; old and new instances overlap for up to twenty minutes.
The existing API uses PostgreSQL and the proposal introduces no new storage or third-party dependency.
The record-body-field flag is available and currently off.
Mobile clients may remain offline for 45 days, and no content null backfill is scheduled this quarter.
If the partner export cannot read content, that night's export fails and is retried the next night.
The v1 route is used by all three supplied clients.
